      reveals.
  - itemId: Keys
    text: A set of keys. Something in this place must be locked.
  - itemId: Fuel
    text: A gas tank. The helicopter needs fuel to fly.
  - itemId: TailRotor
    text: A tail rotor. Without it, the helicopter won't leave the ground.
